"Azure Rabbit is a Rabbit class trait: a magic coat that aids the Rabbit's running."
"It turns a share of gravity's pull into force when the Rabbit kicks off ground."
"It grows stronger as speed rises, but stamina still limits the Rabbit."
"It works only while the Rabbit carries an item, and drops out if the item is dropped."
"It is toggled on and off like a switch in the head or through the interface."
